Bundled part geometry
=====================

`client.js` embeds triangle geometry derived from the LDraw Parts Library
(https://library.ldraw.org), which is licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0). The geometry is a derived work: the .dat files
were expanded into triangles at build time (see `build_parts.py` upstream).
Attribution:

  LDraw Parts Library, LDraw.org contributors, CC BY 4.0
  https://library.ldraw.org

LEGO® and BrickLink® are trademarks of the LEGO Group and BrickLink
respectively. This project is unofficial and is not endorsed by or affiliated
with the LEGO Group, BrickLink, or Studio 2.0.
